WEBVTT

01:33.080 --> 01:35.414
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:35.454 --> 01:37.727
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:38.267 --> 01:40.616
(Episode 12)

02:09.095 --> 02:10.095
(Let's go abroad.)

02:11.223 --> 02:13.262
(Qin Qin, let's go abroad together.)

02:14.076 --> 02:15.577
(We'll never come back again, okay?)

02:23.552 --> 02:24.552
Bye, Yan Chen.

02:47.422 --> 02:49.582
Excuse me, did you call for a designated driver?

03:15.805 --> 03:17.472
You have three years of driving experience?

03:19.680 --> 03:21.200
I've been working as a part-time designated driver for three years.

03:22.011 --> 03:23.011
Don't worry.

03:23.095 --> 03:24.215
I drive very steadily.

03:24.366 --> 03:25.806
I always get five-star ratings.

03:26.749 --> 03:28.582
Are you not going to work at the bar anymore?

03:28.959 --> 03:29.959
I just got off work.

03:31.954 --> 03:32.954
Did you just graduate?

03:33.816 --> 03:34.816
I'm in my senior year.

03:36.023 --> 03:37.463
You have quite a few part-time jobs.

03:37.877 --> 03:40.077
I want to pay off my student loan as soon as possible.

04:01.317 --> 04:02.877
I'll park the car here for you.

04:03.136 --> 04:04.303
Give me the payment QR code.

04:05.287 --> 04:07.287
No need, you can make the payment on the platform.

04:07.312 --> 04:08.312
I know.

04:08.357 --> 04:09.791
I want your WeChat payment QR code.

04:23.272 --> 04:24.272
It's getting late.

04:24.297 --> 04:25.297
Take a cab home.

04:26.108 --> 04:27.108
Key.

04:56.172 --> 04:57.172
Watch out.

05:00.276 --> 05:01.276
Be safe.

05:32.341 --> 05:33.341
Where is my chessboard?

05:35.644 --> 05:36.644
Who let you touch it?

05:40.903 --> 05:42.142
Can't I touch it?

05:42.785 --> 05:43.785
You can touch it.

05:44.687 --> 05:46.787
But before you touch it, shouldn't you ask me first?

05:49.058 --> 05:51.979
Sorry, I won't make the same mistake next time.

05:54.864 --> 05:56.504
Do you also like playing checkers?

05:56.532 --> 05:58.599
We should play together if we have the opportunity.

05:58.834 --> 05:59.993
My skill is alright.

06:04.773 --> 06:06.040
We can also play Chinese chess.

06:22.525 --> 06:26.863
Captain Song, do you usually conduct bed checks?

06:26.983 --> 06:28.822
I'll accompany you to check tomorrow.

06:29.063 --> 06:31.183
I can observe and learn along the way.

06:36.906 --> 06:37.906
Good night.

07:50.513 --> 07:51.513
Instructor.

07:52.103 --> 07:53.877
Hello, Instructor.

07:55.583 --> 07:56.903
It's break time now.

07:57.222 --> 07:58.723
Yes, it's our break time.

07:58.748 --> 07:59.983
That's why we're working out to relax.

07:59.988 --> 08:01.457
It's a great stress reliever, Instructor.

08:01.475 --> 08:03.422
-Let's exercise together. -Exercise with us, Instructor.

08:03.423 --> 08:04.462
Exercise with us.

08:10.435 --> 08:11.901
He's astonished. Let's continue.

08:11.902 --> 08:13.142
Go on with your workout.

08:16.623 --> 08:17.901
Pi Pi, turn on the music.

08:17.902 --> 08:18.902
Music!

08:25.014 --> 08:26.014
What did you say?

08:27.082 --> 08:29.082
I think you're putting too much pressure on them.

08:29.652 --> 08:31.586
They train during the day and exercise at night.

08:32.103 --> 08:33.742
Their body never gets to rest.

08:34.657 --> 08:36.424
Everything needs to be done in moderation.

08:36.685 --> 08:38.966
I think you should reduce their training volume.

08:42.498 --> 08:44.779
If you have nothing to do, there are files over there.

08:44.967 --> 08:45.967
Go read them.

08:47.942 --> 08:49.182
It can't go on like this.

08:49.638 --> 08:51.772
They can't achieve good results with an exhausted body.

08:52.241 --> 08:54.760
Scientific training requires rest.

08:55.878 --> 08:57.238
The situation on-site

08:57.263 --> 08:59.982
is much more complex, difficult and dangerous than on the training field.

09:01.951 --> 09:04.591
If they don't train hard, they will die in real combat.

09:06.263 --> 09:07.423
Be harsh to yourself.

09:08.222 --> 09:11.263
This tradition is deeply ingrained in Shili Tai.

09:11.662 --> 09:13.542
I know it's deeply ingrained in Shili Tai.

09:13.829 --> 09:16.663
You think I never did any research before I came? I read the materials.

09:17.135 --> 09:20.495
The new recruits' physical fitness test ranked second in the city.

09:20.703 --> 09:22.537
They ranked third in the training assessment.

09:24.822 --> 09:26.289
Doesn't that indicate the problem?

09:26.442 --> 09:29.442
The training on Shili Tai isn't about achieving good results in assessments.

09:30.079 --> 09:32.000
If we waste time on fixed subjects,

09:32.381 --> 09:34.348
how is this any different from exam-oriented education?

09:35.494 --> 09:36.494
Courage,

09:36.886 --> 09:37.886
bravery,

09:38.438 --> 09:39.879
and the will to withstand pressure.

09:40.783 --> 09:44.303
These are the intangible things that they need to train.

09:54.170 --> 09:55.810
Lin Hao, where is it?

09:55.835 --> 09:57.644
The car by the roadside. Go and take a look.

09:57.673 --> 09:58.673
Okay.

09:59.982 --> 10:00.982
-Hello. -Hello.

10:01.243 --> 10:02.310
You have something for us?

10:02.342 --> 10:03.742
-Yes. -What is it?

10:04.102 --> 10:05.462
-Don't you know? -We have no idea.

10:05.702 --> 10:06.702
Take a look at it.

10:07.550 --> 10:08.550
There's so much.

10:09.242 --> 10:10.309
We can't take all of this.

10:10.466 --> 10:12.669
Da Peng, go get Pi Pi, Ge and the others.

10:12.688 --> 10:13.688
Okay.

10:15.143 --> 10:16.341
It's still warm.

10:16.342 --> 10:17.622
You guys are fast.

10:17.626 --> 10:19.795
We're delivering food to you. Of course we need to be fast.

10:19.822 --> 10:21.298
Brothers, we have extra food!

10:21.502 --> 10:22.502
Guys!

10:24.161 --> 10:25.442
You guys eat.

10:25.911 --> 10:26.950
It's still cold.

10:28.231 --> 10:29.231
Take it yourself.

10:29.305 --> 10:30.384
Take it yourself.

10:30.416 --> 10:32.342
-Hurry up. -No need to fight.

10:33.303 --> 10:35.066
Having a passive attitude toward meals is a problem.

10:35.311 --> 10:37.071
-It smells good. -Help yourself.

10:38.981 --> 10:40.020
Captain!

10:40.543 --> 10:42.422
Captain, Instructor, come over and eat with us.

10:42.423 --> 10:43.702
-Yes, eat it while it's hot. -You guys eat.

10:43.951 --> 10:45.872
Captain, you have to eat it.

10:45.897 --> 10:46.998
It's all thanks to you.

10:47.023 --> 10:48.222
A supporter sent this to us.

10:49.258 --> 10:50.258
What?

10:50.292 --> 10:52.373
She mentioned you by name and thanked you

10:52.398 --> 10:54.398
for saving her at the mall last time.

10:54.803 --> 10:57.283
Yes, she even sent several boxes of lemonade.

10:57.308 --> 10:58.308
It's still cold.

10:58.400 --> 10:59.400
Captain.

11:02.183 --> 11:03.183
What are you doing?

11:03.372 --> 11:04.706
The fire station has regulations.

11:04.739 --> 11:07.673
You can't accept gifts and presents from the public. Don't you know this?

11:17.686 --> 11:18.686
Next time.

11:19.989 --> 11:21.589
We'll strictly adhere to it next time.

11:22.063 --> 11:24.023
Isn't there a rule in our fire station?

11:24.543 --> 11:25.810
It's prohibited to waste food.

11:26.672 --> 11:27.912
Wasting is shameful.

11:38.303 --> 11:39.462
He's gone. Give it to me.

11:39.582 --> 11:41.502
-Thank you, Instructor. -Thank you, Instructor.

11:42.303 --> 11:43.783
Thank Captain Song.

11:44.183 --> 11:46.143
Thank you, Captain Song!

11:49.618 --> 11:50.618
(Hello.)

11:50.982 --> 11:52.222
Song Yan?

11:52.982 --> 11:54.702
Why did you take the initiative to call me today?

11:54.854 --> 11:56.453
How's the food? Do you like it?

11:56.663 --> 11:57.822
What do you want to eat tomorrow?

11:57.860 --> 12:01.179
Zhan Xiao Rao, I made it very clear to you that night.

12:01.982 --> 12:03.342
Don't send anything over.

12:03.943 --> 12:05.702
It's my choice whether to send it or not.

12:05.855 --> 12:07.454
It's your attitude whether to accept it or not.

12:07.502 --> 12:09.663
If you don't like it, just throw it in the trash can.

12:11.183 --> 12:13.943
Do you think wasting food is a small matter?

12:14.960 --> 12:16.759
Are you angry?

12:17.783 --> 12:19.942
I really think you're great.

12:19.943 --> 12:21.263
I want to develop a relationship with you.

12:21.862 --> 12:23.263
You and Xu Qin are friends, right?

12:24.854 --> 12:25.854
She's my first love.

12:35.231 --> 12:36.231
Let's go.

12:46.663 --> 12:47.783
What brings you here?

12:49.411 --> 12:50.943
-What's wrong? -Take it.

12:52.982 --> 12:54.701
I need to read 20 pages of a book tonight.

12:54.702 --> 12:56.582
I have to work tomorrow. I can't drink.

12:57.253 --> 12:59.318
You focus on your book as I drink my wine.

13:06.162 --> 13:07.162
What's wrong?

13:11.967 --> 13:14.201
If you want to drink, why don't you go to Xiao Yi Xiao?

13:14.370 --> 13:16.703
Why would I look for him? I want to settle accounts with you!

13:17.143 --> 13:18.943
Me? What did I do?

13:20.143 --> 13:21.342
What did you do?

13:25.702 --> 13:27.023
Is Song Yan your ex-boyfriend?

13:28.951 --> 13:29.951
He told you about it?

13:29.985 --> 13:32.062
That's uncool of you. You didn't even tell me.

13:32.702 --> 13:34.182
I didn't know how to tell you.

13:34.183 --> 13:35.663
Use your mouth, seriously...

13:40.982 --> 13:42.423
Sorry.

13:49.605 --> 13:50.605
Forget it.

13:51.982 --> 13:54.622
Once we finish this drink, we'll move on from this matter.

13:59.311 --> 14:01.270
You told me you liked him so much.

14:01.684 --> 14:02.951
You're not pursuing him anymore?

14:03.183 --> 14:05.821
I won't get involved with my best friend's boyfriend and ex.

14:05.822 --> 14:06.822
This is my bottom line.

14:09.263 --> 14:10.263
Why are you laughing?

14:10.526 --> 14:12.193
Did you not take me as your best friend?

14:12.828 --> 14:14.762
You act as if we've been friends for very long.

14:19.862 --> 14:23.296
But I feel like he still likes you.

14:28.043 --> 14:29.204
Do you still like him too?

14:29.712 --> 14:31.212
Why don't you two get back together?

14:32.113 --> 14:33.482
We haven't seen each other for 10 years.

14:33.502 --> 14:34.542
That doesn't matter.

14:34.543 --> 14:36.101
You're both single.

14:36.102 --> 14:38.903
Childhood sweethearts, rekindling the past. It's perfect.

14:42.502 --> 14:44.622
You don't have any other ex-boyfriends, do you?

14:45.342 --> 14:47.582
I don't have any ex-boyfriends. He's the only one.

14:48.943 --> 14:51.474
You've only had one boyfriend?

14:51.834 --> 14:54.234
I didn't have anyone before him. I didn't have anyone after him either.

14:55.143 --> 14:56.861
Then what are you waiting for?

14:56.862 --> 14:59.222
Life is too short not to love.

14:59.383 --> 15:00.663
Hurry up.

15:00.976 --> 15:02.488
It's hard to explain in a few words.

15:07.383 --> 15:09.050
Is it because your family doesn't approve?

15:10.742 --> 15:11.981
Our parents are all the same.

15:11.982 --> 15:13.742
They say it's for your own good.

15:13.982 --> 15:16.582
But it's just an excuse to cover up their need for control.

15:16.826 --> 15:18.159
I won't let them have their way.

15:18.783 --> 15:21.501
If parents are being unreasonable, I'll be even worse than them.

15:21.502 --> 15:23.502
Create a fuss a couple of times, and they will know your bottom line.

15:23.903 --> 15:25.663
I've heard about your mom's temper.

15:28.237 --> 15:29.316
What can you do?

15:29.341 --> 15:30.861
I'm not as brave as you.

15:31.822 --> 15:34.903
I can only accumulate strength slowly to change their mindset.

15:35.800 --> 15:37.895
If I can become a deputy chief physician this time,

15:39.183 --> 15:40.423
my salary will increase.

15:40.983 --> 15:43.142
At least I can achieve some financial independence.

15:44.023 --> 15:45.822
You have to be mentally prepared.

15:45.855 --> 15:47.734
It's not easy to change their mindset.

15:49.291 --> 15:50.291
All the best!

15:50.316 --> 15:51.316
All the best!

15:58.335 --> 16:00.095
What do you think of the new instructor?

16:00.903 --> 16:03.303
I think Captain Song doesn't like him.

16:03.471 --> 16:05.192
He's definitely closer to Jun.

16:07.103 --> 16:08.262
I don't like him either.

16:08.944 --> 16:09.944
Why?

16:12.823 --> 16:13.823
Just a gut feeling.

16:14.450 --> 16:15.750
Your gut feeling means nothing.

16:16.669 --> 16:17.750
Stop blabbering here.

16:18.220 --> 16:19.220
Go to sleep.

16:20.856 --> 16:21.856
Go to sleep.

16:27.943 --> 16:28.943
Go to sleep.

16:31.734 --> 16:32.734
You got kicked.

17:00.930 --> 17:01.930
Quick.

17:08.424 --> 17:10.063
Dress right, dress.

17:11.367 --> 17:12.607
Eyes front.

17:12.903 --> 17:13.903
Stand at ease.

17:14.043 --> 17:15.043
Stand at attention.

17:18.502 --> 17:20.622
Vice-captain, Squad Three has assembled.

17:20.623 --> 17:21.862
Eight people are present as expected.

17:21.863 --> 17:23.163
-Please give instructions. -Join the squad.

17:23.319 --> 17:24.319
Yes, sir.

17:29.158 --> 17:30.799
Today, we're running 20 kilometers.

17:30.824 --> 17:32.569
Everyone must pay attention to safety, okay?

17:32.595 --> 17:34.835
You must follow the designated route.

17:34.860 --> 17:35.900
Yes, sir!

17:40.694 --> 17:42.735
Instructor, what are you doing here?

17:42.967 --> 17:44.086
To run with everyone.

17:45.567 --> 17:48.166
Instructor, we're carrying heavy loads for 20 kilometers

17:48.177 --> 17:49.310
and also climbing mountains.

17:49.343 --> 17:51.183
Let's take a breath of fresh air together.

17:51.447 --> 17:53.288
-Let's go! -Okay, Jun Ping.

17:53.582 --> 17:54.582
Depart now.

17:54.623 --> 17:55.702
Turn to the right!

17:56.085 --> 17:57.765
Left turn, run.

17:58.462 --> 18:01.143
One, one, one, two, one.

18:01.343 --> 18:03.943
One, one, one, two, one.

18:04.064 --> 18:06.824
One, one, one, two, one.

18:07.647 --> 18:08.768
Can the instructor make it?

18:09.024 --> 18:10.863
No way, I bet five kilometers.

18:10.928 --> 18:12.087
He won't make it back.

18:19.041 --> 18:20.041
Quick!

18:20.062 --> 18:21.103
Catch up with the squad.

19:43.926 --> 19:44.926
Slow down.

19:45.256 --> 19:46.256
Jun Ping, quick.

19:49.231 --> 19:50.231
What is this?

19:50.982 --> 19:51.982
Da Peng, not bad.

19:52.301 --> 19:53.301
Da Peng.

19:53.335 --> 19:55.001
Da Peng! Not bad!

19:58.103 --> 20:00.343
-Pi Pi! -You're going to fail soon. Hurry up!

20:04.079 --> 20:05.079
Okay.

20:06.835 --> 20:08.022
Oh my God.

20:09.782 --> 20:11.382
Not bad. The results are still okay.

20:11.383 --> 20:13.117
But compared to our time, you're far worse.

20:13.322 --> 20:15.893
Jun Ping, what's the matter with you? You're even worse than the new recruit.

20:16.262 --> 20:19.343
No, Vice-captain, isn't it my job to keep them safe?

20:19.423 --> 20:22.462
-Cut it out. -Da Peng, where's the instructor?

20:24.262 --> 20:26.622
Instructor ran out of energy when he was climbing the mountain.

20:26.623 --> 20:28.183
We tried to support him, but he refused.

20:28.736 --> 20:31.373
Instructor has never run 20 kilometers. And he was carrying a heavy load.

20:31.823 --> 20:33.462
-None of you waited for him? -I...

20:33.487 --> 20:35.412
Alright, I bet he's worn out from running.

20:35.444 --> 20:36.444
We'll wait for a while, it's okay.

20:36.469 --> 20:37.868
I knew he couldn't handle it from the start.

20:37.879 --> 20:40.142
-What should we do if something happens -He'll be fine. He's a grown-up.

20:40.143 --> 20:41.143
Wait for a while.

20:41.649 --> 20:44.086
Alright, guys. You may fall out. Have a good rest.

20:44.103 --> 20:45.623
-Okay. -Okay, Vice-captain.

20:45.853 --> 20:46.856
Take it easy.

20:46.863 --> 20:48.462
Pi Pi, eat a bit more for lunch.

20:48.890 --> 20:49.959
You're too skinny.

20:49.982 --> 20:50.982
Thank you, Squad Leader.

20:51.158 --> 20:52.398
-Let's go. -Hurry up.

20:53.963 --> 20:55.182
Bye, Vice-captain.

21:02.872 --> 21:03.872
Is this okay?

21:03.897 --> 21:04.897
It's okay.

21:20.623 --> 21:21.623
Oh my God.

21:21.982 --> 21:24.903
It's so late, why isn't he back yet? His stamina is really bad.

21:25.161 --> 21:26.321
It's getting dark.

21:27.163 --> 21:28.163
Stop waiting.

21:28.712 --> 21:29.712
-Captain. -Captain.

21:30.032 --> 21:31.272
-Call him. -Okay.

21:35.978 --> 21:36.978
The call got through.

21:37.271 --> 21:38.271
No one answered.

21:38.507 --> 21:39.507
Take the car.

21:39.532 --> 21:40.532
Bring him back.

21:40.543 --> 21:41.543
Okay.

21:57.460 --> 21:58.460
Captain.

21:59.536 --> 22:00.736
-Yang Chi. -Yes, sir.

22:00.763 --> 22:01.763
No need to go.

22:02.798 --> 22:03.798
He's back.

22:48.410 --> 22:49.410
-Jiang Yi. -Yes, sir.

22:49.445 --> 22:51.246
-Take good care of the instructor. -Yes, sir.

22:54.148 --> 22:55.518
You've worked hard, Instructor.

23:02.423 --> 23:04.464
Instructor, have a sip of warm water.

23:11.567 --> 23:12.686
Instructor, take it easy.

23:24.070 --> 23:27.070
The previous instructor was excellent, right?

23:28.302 --> 23:29.302
I've heard about him.

23:30.586 --> 23:33.386
Yes, Jun is very nice.

23:35.224 --> 23:36.224
Do you all

23:38.958 --> 23:40.359
dislike me?

23:41.163 --> 23:42.163
Not really.

23:43.742 --> 23:44.742
How should I put it?

23:45.067 --> 23:47.919
Instructor, let me tell you the truth, don't get angry.

23:49.816 --> 23:52.426
Do you feel like you're part of our team?

23:54.410 --> 23:55.410
I think.

23:57.480 --> 23:58.879
Song Yan and I have disagreements.

24:00.039 --> 24:01.039
Disagreements?

24:01.684 --> 24:02.684
What do you mean?

24:04.894 --> 24:05.934
He's too rigid

24:06.742 --> 24:07.742
and too harsh.

24:08.302 --> 24:11.022
Instructor, you have to think the other way around.

24:11.383 --> 24:12.742
He can't be lenient.

24:13.362 --> 24:15.122
The value of life is above all else.

24:16.565 --> 24:19.165
Captain is highly sentimental.

24:20.302 --> 24:21.383
But he doesn't express it.

24:22.542 --> 24:23.542
As for his strictness,

24:24.302 --> 24:25.542
it's definitely for discipline.

24:25.863 --> 24:28.143
This fire station is like being at war.

24:28.623 --> 24:30.103
Discipline is above all else.

24:31.914 --> 24:33.154
What was

24:35.383 --> 24:36.550
the former instructor like?

24:38.006 --> 24:39.047
Previously,

24:40.502 --> 24:41.542
one emphasized discipline,

24:41.791 --> 24:42.924
the other valued emotions.

25:30.005 --> 25:31.005
Instructor!

25:43.940 --> 25:46.344
(China Fire and Rescue)

26:55.583 --> 26:58.622
(It's now 10:13 pm.)

26:58.623 --> 27:00.782
(The temperature is 30.3 degrees Celsius.)

27:02.673 --> 27:03.673
Thank you.

27:47.430 --> 27:49.271
Mom, what brings you here?

27:51.614 --> 27:53.535
It's been a long time since I've been here.

27:53.752 --> 27:55.752
I happened to pass by today.

27:56.302 --> 27:57.469
So I came up to take a look.

28:03.526 --> 28:04.526
Good.

28:05.487 --> 28:06.688
It's pretty clean.

28:12.390 --> 28:14.711
I bought dinner for you.

28:16.372 --> 28:17.372
I'm leaving.

28:18.207 --> 28:19.207
Mom.

28:22.044 --> 28:23.344
Were you thinking that

28:24.382 --> 28:25.743
there are other people at home?

28:29.518 --> 28:30.518
No.

28:30.958 --> 28:32.319
You won't do

28:34.678 --> 28:36.543
anything that would make me sad.

28:40.362 --> 28:41.362
Yes.

28:41.984 --> 28:42.984
I won't.

28:44.359 --> 28:47.319
I've been thinking these past few days.

28:49.630 --> 28:52.471
Can I stop being like this all the time?

28:53.678 --> 28:54.678
Can I

28:56.519 --> 28:57.999
be bold for once?

29:02.519 --> 29:07.623
When your brother paid a fine to the bank, I knew something was off.

29:10.000 --> 29:11.520
Is it that guy surnamed Song?

29:12.628 --> 29:14.795
The parents behave improperly, and their son follows suit.

29:15.103 --> 29:18.444
Not a single person in this family has good character.

29:18.469 --> 29:19.476
Mom.

29:21.062 --> 29:22.702
You don't have to attack him like that.

29:24.006 --> 29:25.006
Right now,

29:27.022 --> 29:28.302
I have nothing to do with him.

29:29.126 --> 29:31.007
Do you want to have something to do with him?

29:32.903 --> 29:35.943
If that's the case, then you should go abroad.

29:36.819 --> 29:37.819
Mom,

29:38.623 --> 29:40.262
I feel very sad.

29:40.831 --> 29:41.910
You know what?

29:43.047 --> 29:44.646
He came to my house a few days ago.

29:45.127 --> 29:46.127
He was there.

29:47.103 --> 29:48.343
He made porridge for me.

29:49.022 --> 29:51.262
I've been living here alone for such a long time.

29:51.302 --> 29:53.863
It was the first time I felt at home.

29:55.623 --> 29:58.383
But that feeling quickly disappeared.

29:59.262 --> 30:00.383
He left.

30:00.912 --> 30:02.392
I really wanted to ask him to stay.

30:02.463 --> 30:03.743
But I dared not do so.

30:03.946 --> 30:05.753
Because you were afraid that I'd be upset.

30:05.778 --> 30:07.857
So you want to convince me first.

30:08.551 --> 30:09.551
Mom...

30:09.576 --> 30:12.187
You should dispel this thought as soon as possible.

30:12.456 --> 30:14.175
I already told you.

30:14.296 --> 30:17.697
Don't go against your parents for an outsider.

30:17.990 --> 30:19.751
He doesn't have to be an outsider.

30:22.390 --> 30:24.351
Just a bowl of porridge?

30:24.759 --> 30:27.519
It was just a bowl of porridge and you can't forget about it.

30:28.792 --> 30:31.512
Your dad was worried you'd work too hard.

30:31.752 --> 30:34.551
He bought a house near the hospital for you.

30:34.576 --> 30:35.569
He bought you a car.

30:35.776 --> 30:38.055
And the best hospital,

30:38.080 --> 30:40.441
including the best team of physicians to guide you.

30:40.879 --> 30:45.152
I joined this hospital based on my own abilities.

30:47.015 --> 30:48.735
Don't be silly, kid.

30:49.158 --> 30:50.598
That's because your surname is Meng.

30:50.999 --> 30:52.799
You don't have to know about the ways of the world.

30:53.311 --> 30:55.511
You don't have to please Deputy Dean Liu.

30:55.950 --> 30:57.430
You can do whatever you want.

30:58.327 --> 31:01.087
It's because your family has got your back.

31:01.264 --> 31:02.943
Look at your dad and brother.

31:02.968 --> 31:04.049
For the sake of this family,

31:04.074 --> 31:06.474
they are facing all kinds of pressures every day.

31:07.022 --> 31:08.302
They work hard.

31:09.111 --> 31:10.111
But you?

31:12.062 --> 31:13.782
For this little bit of affection,

31:16.343 --> 31:17.543
a bowl of porridge,

31:17.553 --> 31:19.331
you act as if you're on the verge of dying.

31:19.555 --> 31:21.635
You forget the gratitude toward your parents.

31:22.535 --> 31:23.654
I remember it.

31:23.831 --> 31:25.390
Of course I remember it, Mom.

31:25.861 --> 31:28.220
That's why I've been restraining myself.

31:28.543 --> 31:29.783
I've been in pain.

31:29.879 --> 31:31.759
I don't want to make you sad.

31:36.672 --> 31:37.672
Qin Qin.

31:40.142 --> 31:42.302
I don't ask for anything from you.

31:46.431 --> 31:47.511
All I want

31:48.646 --> 31:50.686
is that you can be an obedient child.

31:53.022 --> 31:55.022
Okay. Dress right, dress.

31:56.408 --> 31:57.527
Eyes front.

31:57.626 --> 31:58.626
Stand at ease.

32:01.510 --> 32:05.510
For the new recruit assessment, you must get a good grade.

32:05.569 --> 32:08.035
Captain said that if you don't get good grades,

32:08.423 --> 32:10.343
you have to pack and leave.

32:10.506 --> 32:11.506
Do you have confidence?

32:11.735 --> 32:12.735
Yes!

32:12.838 --> 32:13.972
Can you embarrass Shili Tai?

32:14.031 --> 32:15.190
Yes!

32:15.776 --> 32:16.776
Yes?

32:18.266 --> 32:19.266
No!

32:19.281 --> 32:21.145
-Louder! -No!

32:21.170 --> 32:22.170
Set off.

32:48.237 --> 32:49.427
(Entry Control)

33:24.132 --> 33:25.481
(China Fire and Rescue)

33:26.079 --> 33:28.083
Even if I have a limp, we still get the highest total score.

33:28.103 --> 33:29.572
Tell me, how should we celebrate?

33:29.585 --> 33:31.105
-That's right. -Let's celebrate.

33:31.130 --> 33:32.571
But it's your treat.

33:32.586 --> 33:34.123
-You guys are so weak. -We treat you?

33:34.157 --> 33:35.662
You came first in place, and we have to treat you?

33:35.663 --> 33:36.696
Are you kidding me?

33:38.271 --> 33:39.838
Slow down.

33:39.863 --> 33:41.102
-This way. -Slow down.

33:41.103 --> 33:42.822
-Come, watch out. -Quick.

33:42.823 --> 33:43.823
Slow down.

33:44.327 --> 33:45.327
Okay.

33:45.983 --> 33:46.983
Indeed.

33:47.335 --> 33:48.496
What do you think, Da Peng?

33:49.703 --> 33:51.063
What do you mean?

33:51.874 --> 33:53.512
If you don't treat us...

33:57.319 --> 33:58.482
Don't touch that!

33:58.760 --> 33:59.760
Don't take them from me!

34:00.455 --> 34:01.975
They're all my babies.

34:01.984 --> 34:03.017
Take care of your injuries.

34:03.062 --> 34:05.382
All of you are taking the opportunity to steal my things.

34:05.383 --> 34:07.182
Do you know how expensive they are?

34:07.183 --> 34:08.981
They're all my babies.

34:08.982 --> 34:10.461
You've snatched them all.

34:10.462 --> 34:11.621
You guys are over the line.

34:11.622 --> 34:12.622
What's wrong?

34:14.823 --> 34:16.674
-Instructor... -Hello, Instructor.

34:17.780 --> 34:20.037
Instructor, I'm left with an empty box.

34:20.062 --> 34:21.319
They've snatched them all.

34:21.344 --> 34:22.903
Da Peng, how's your leg?

34:24.140 --> 34:25.340
I applied some medicine to it.

34:25.365 --> 34:26.378
It's much better now.

34:28.257 --> 34:29.616
Take it easy.

34:32.343 --> 34:35.144
Instructor, we didn't embarrass Captain today, right?

34:35.169 --> 34:36.408
Of course not.

34:36.433 --> 34:37.533
You guys performed very well.

34:37.798 --> 34:39.037
I think he's happy.

34:39.062 --> 34:40.062
He's secretly elated.

34:42.026 --> 34:44.388
Can you take this opportunity

34:44.895 --> 34:46.366
to ask Captain

34:46.680 --> 34:48.217
to let us go to the fire scene sooner?

34:48.423 --> 34:49.423
Yes.

34:49.424 --> 34:50.895
Yes, Instructor.

34:50.920 --> 34:51.920
No way.

34:52.101 --> 34:54.181
We have to follow the rules and regulations.

34:54.206 --> 34:55.758
You've been waiting for so long. Just wait a little longer.

34:55.783 --> 34:57.022
It's almost time.

34:57.288 --> 34:58.997
These regulations are unreasonable.

34:59.022 --> 35:01.022
That's right. We're so capable now.

35:01.048 --> 35:02.562
Why don't you talk to him yourselves?

35:03.479 --> 35:04.638
Forget it.

35:04.663 --> 35:05.942
I'm afraid of being scolded.

35:06.870 --> 35:08.070
Is he that scary?

35:08.223 --> 35:09.582
Yes!

35:10.152 --> 35:11.712
-Song Yan. -It's not negotiable.

35:12.521 --> 35:14.432
I think the performance of the new recruits in the assessment

35:14.462 --> 35:15.743
is really outstanding.

35:17.720 --> 35:20.359
Some fire missions can be handed over to them.

35:20.498 --> 35:21.557
It can also accelerate

35:21.595 --> 35:23.278
the transition between the new and old members of the fire station.

35:23.303 --> 35:24.703
A fire scene is not an amusement park.

35:25.823 --> 35:27.021
Passing the assessment

35:27.022 --> 35:28.328
only shows that their technical skills meet the standard.

35:28.582 --> 35:29.662
Their ability to respond on the spot,

35:30.062 --> 35:31.102
psychological resilience

35:31.343 --> 35:32.343
and mental willpower

35:33.102 --> 35:34.102
still need to be trained.

35:34.103 --> 35:35.541
That's why they need practical experience

35:35.542 --> 35:37.542
and missions to accelerate their growth.

35:38.415 --> 35:40.855
When you've learned the word "sacrifice",

35:41.022 --> 35:42.437
then only you come to me to ask for another chance.

35:42.462 --> 35:44.863
Sometimes sacrifice is avoidable.

35:45.088 --> 35:47.208
Under current technological conditions,

35:47.622 --> 35:49.903
the safety factor has greatly improved.

35:50.593 --> 35:52.593
In the fire at a high-rise apartment in Dongjiang,

35:53.237 --> 35:54.338
there were two casualties.

35:55.228 --> 35:56.899
The chemical plant explosion at Liaoning,

35:57.383 --> 35:58.582
four casualties.

35:59.368 --> 36:02.676
The fire at Mountain 625 at Shannan, 17 casualties.

36:04.128 --> 36:05.927
Their average age is less than 22 years old.

36:10.720 --> 36:12.200
Sacrifice is indeed not a tradition,

36:13.903 --> 36:15.263
but it's the reality

36:16.502 --> 36:17.823
this team has to face.

36:27.479 --> 36:28.840
I actually don't understand.

36:29.705 --> 36:31.465
With your family background,

36:32.152 --> 36:33.702
you can get opportunities anywhere.

36:33.869 --> 36:35.732
Why do you have to come here to make trouble?

36:36.438 --> 36:37.851
What's that supposed to mean?

36:39.708 --> 36:41.371
Do you think I'm here for opportunities?

36:42.509 --> 36:44.313
What's wrong with my family background?

36:44.662 --> 36:47.223
Captain Song, I think this is reverse discrimination.

36:47.683 --> 36:48.920
Can't I love this profession?

36:48.943 --> 36:51.250
I like this profession. I want to do something for this profession, can't I?

36:54.056 --> 36:55.151
Yes, I know.

36:55.309 --> 36:57.190
It's hard for you to accept me emotionally.

36:57.232 --> 36:59.272
I'm here to take over from Instructor Suo.

37:00.312 --> 37:01.312
There are many things

37:01.831 --> 37:04.431
that I can't empathize with you like he did,

37:04.467 --> 37:06.034
or have a tacit understanding with you.

37:07.436 --> 37:09.315
But we can develop that over time.

37:11.696 --> 37:13.216
I just want you to know one thing.

37:13.676 --> 37:14.676
I'm

37:16.425 --> 37:17.865
not here to fool around.

37:42.134 --> 37:43.451
(Student's dormitory)

37:50.967 --> 37:52.728
Are you still selling cosmetics?

37:54.672 --> 37:56.471
These are cheap little brands.

37:56.536 --> 37:57.679
These are authentic products.

37:57.752 --> 37:59.134
I've been fined so much money,

37:59.155 --> 38:00.455
I need to make up for the money.

38:00.656 --> 38:03.015
Right, do you know any quick ways to make money?

38:04.152 --> 38:06.428
I really need to earn money now.

38:07.625 --> 38:10.264
When I find a way to make money, we can make money together.

38:10.799 --> 38:11.839
Thanks, sister.

38:11.864 --> 38:13.145
Do you need money that badly?

38:14.303 --> 38:16.462
We're graduating soon, and I feel anxious.

38:17.271 --> 38:19.271
Besides, our major is very niche.

38:19.903 --> 38:21.227
The wages are low.

38:21.760 --> 38:23.839
I'm not a local like you guys.

38:24.513 --> 38:28.272
If I want to stay here after graduation, I won't even be able to afford the rent.

38:30.591 --> 38:32.271
Find a rich boyfriend then.

38:33.272 --> 38:34.471
You know what?

38:34.496 --> 38:38.455
Wu Qing Qing in the next dormitory found one.

38:38.799 --> 38:40.119
That kind of guy.

38:40.914 --> 38:42.239
No wonder.

38:42.264 --> 38:44.554
The last time I saw her, she was carrying a Chanel bag.

38:44.733 --> 38:46.213
I thought it was fake.

38:46.450 --> 38:47.490
It's authentic.

38:47.696 --> 38:49.536
Doesn't she feel bad about it?

38:49.584 --> 38:50.903
Who knows?

38:51.568 --> 38:53.452
Girls, can we have some ambition?

38:54.135 --> 38:56.640
When it comes to making money, we should rely on ourselves.

38:56.679 --> 38:58.146
Relying on a boyfriend is useless.

38:58.608 --> 39:00.007
Just wait and see.

39:00.013 --> 39:01.050
I, Zhai Miao,

39:01.062 --> 39:04.182
will definitely become a boss through my own efforts.

39:04.441 --> 39:06.081
Boss, I wish you success soon.

39:06.517 --> 39:07.557
Okay.

39:07.582 --> 39:08.961
I'll hold hands with the boss.

39:08.986 --> 39:09.986
Come.

39:11.145 --> 39:12.145
You can hold this hand.

39:12.232 --> 39:13.633
Thank you, boss.

39:59.922 --> 40:00.949
Ye Zi.

40:02.839 --> 40:04.166
This is your campus card, right?

40:05.680 --> 40:07.424
-So you picked it up. -No.

40:07.447 --> 40:09.418
Someone picked it up and sent it here.

40:09.423 --> 40:10.582
Who sent it here?

40:11.127 --> 40:12.247
A young man.

40:12.519 --> 40:13.680
He was wearing a suit.

40:14.111 --> 40:15.151
He's quite handsome.

40:15.688 --> 40:16.867
Aunt, when did he send it?

40:16.892 --> 40:18.259
He just sent it here a moment ago.

40:19.104 --> 40:20.104
Thanks, Aunt.

40:24.800 --> 40:25.800
Wait!

40:30.840 --> 40:31.840
Thanks.

40:32.811 --> 40:33.811
Don't mention it.

40:56.132 --> 40:57.132
You said

40:57.991 --> 40:59.512
it's your dream to be a firefighter.

41:00.369 --> 41:01.369
Is that true?

41:03.656 --> 41:05.056
Of course.

41:07.209 --> 41:08.689
Have you watched Burning Flame?

41:10.479 --> 41:11.479
No.

41:15.087 --> 41:16.607
You want to do well in this field,

41:16.719 --> 41:17.933
to make a difference.

41:20.416 --> 41:21.457
I'm touched.

41:23.492 --> 41:24.492
Logically speaking,

41:25.461 --> 41:27.639
you have plenty of choices and opportunities to try different things.

41:28.207 --> 41:31.366
Any other profession is more glamorous than this one.

41:35.040 --> 41:37.080
But I happen to like this profession.

41:38.007 --> 41:41.648
If I can make some significant changes,

41:42.312 --> 41:43.662
that would be even better.

41:49.018 --> 41:50.018
What's wrong?

41:53.536 --> 41:54.576
I envy you.

41:55.224 --> 41:56.224
These kinds of words...

41:56.895 --> 41:58.415
You can say it so easily.

42:01.951 --> 42:02.951
I meant it.

42:03.744 --> 42:04.744
Indeed.

42:05.415 --> 42:08.176
I'm being a bit audacious.

42:09.862 --> 42:11.223
Your parents must be very supportive of you, right?

42:13.839 --> 42:15.799
My mother supports me in everything.

42:17.254 --> 42:19.510
My dad isn't exactly like that.

42:20.232 --> 42:21.386
But he said,

42:21.600 --> 42:22.839
no matter what I do,

42:23.110 --> 42:24.724
I just need to be a man of integrity.

42:25.696 --> 42:26.696
That's what matters.

42:28.303 --> 42:29.743
Your dad also supports you, right?

42:34.326 --> 42:35.926
He's also a man of integrity.
